(text "A2OOI_J2 testbench (tools/kicad/gen_aoi.py, stimulus and .meas from tools/spice/aoi_tb.py).\nSTIM_x (HV PWL, ideal) -> divider -> driver triode (Ra 10k) -> divider -> x (LV DUT input): real edges and levels.\nThe output -> one divider (C1 3.9 pF per grid) -> Y_LV -> load tubes, both grids on the net.\nStates (ABCD) 2 us each: 0000 1000 1100 0100 1100 1000 1010 1011 1001 1011 1010 0010 0110 0111 0110 0111 0101 1101 1111 1110 1011 1110 0000 (aoi_sweep.CELLS['a22']).\nThe plain-SPICE run of the same bench: python3 tools/spice/aoi_tb.py a22" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 312.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "19cd0135-7c27-454e-82f1-c16eb356d909"))
(text ".meas tran y0 find v(/Y) at=1.950u\n.meas tran y1 find v(/Y) at=3.950u\n.meas tran y2 find v(/Y) at=5.950u\n.meas tran y3 find v(/Y) at=7.950u\n.meas tran y4 find v(/Y) at=9.950u\n.meas tran y5 find v(/Y) at=11.950u\n.meas tran y6 find v(/Y) at=13.950u\n.meas tran y7 find v(/Y) at=15.950u\n.meas tran y8 find v(/Y) at=17.950u\n.meas tran y9 find v(/Y) at=19.950u\n.meas tran y10 find v(/Y) at=21.950u\n.meas tran y11 find v(/Y) at=23.950u\n.meas tran y12 find v(/Y) at=25.950u\n.meas tran y13 find v(/Y) at=27.950u\n.meas tran y14 find v(/Y) at=29.950u\n.meas tran y15 find v(/Y) at=31.950u\n.meas tran y16 find v(/Y) at=33.950u\n.meas tran y17 find v(/Y) at=35.950u\n.meas tran y18 find v(/Y) at=37.950u\n.meas tran y19 find v(/Y) at=39.950u\n.meas tran y20 find v(/Y) at=41.950u\n.meas tran y21 find v(/Y) at=43.950u\n.meas tran y22 find v(/Y) at=45.950u\n.meas tran amin min v(/A) from=0.5u to=46.0u\n.meas tran bmin min v(/B) from=0.5u to=46.0u\n.meas tran cmin min v(/C) from=0.5u to=46.0u\n.meas tran dmin min v(/D) from=0.5u to=46.0u\n.meas tran ylmin min v(/Y_LV) from=0.5u to=46.0u\n.meas tran haz20 max v(/Y) from=40.0u to=42.0u\n.meas tran haz21 max v(/Y) from=42.0u to=44.0u\n.meas tran br_100 trig v(/B) val=-5 rise=1 td=3.90u targ v(/Y) val=100 fall=1 td=3.90u\n.meas tran af_100 trig v(/A) val=-5 fall=1 td=5.90u targ v(/Y) val=100 rise=1 td=5.90u\n.meas tran ar_100 trig v(/A) val=-5 rise=1 td=7.90u targ v(/Y) val=100 fall=1 td=7.90u\n.meas tran bf_100 trig v(/B) val=-5 fall=1 td=9.90u targ v(/Y) val=100 rise=1 td=9.90u\n.meas tran dr_101 trig v(/D) val=-5 rise=1 td=13.90u targ v(/Y) val=100 fall=1 td=13.90u\n.meas tran cf_101 trig v(/C) val=-5 fall=1 td=15.90u targ v(/Y) val=100 rise=1 td=15.90u\n.meas tran cr_101 trig v(/C) val=-5 rise=1 td=17.90u targ v(/Y) val=100 fall=1 td=17.90u\n.meas tran df_101 trig v(/D) val=-5 fall=1 td=19.90u targ v(/Y) val=100 rise=1 td=19.90u\n.meas tran dr_011 trig v(/D) val=-5 rise=1 td=25.90u targ v(/Y) val=100 fall=1 td=25.90u\n.meas tran df_011 trig v(/D) val=-5 fall=1 td=27.90u targ v(/Y) val=100 rise=1 td=27.90u\n.meas tran cf_011 trig v(/C) val=-5 fall=1 td=31.90u targ v(/Y) val=100 rise=1 td=31.90u\n.meas tran ar_101 trig v(/A) val=-5 rise=1 td=33.90u targ v(/Y) val=100 fall=1 td=33.90u" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 335.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4025afa0-2d26-4b38-b3aa-fd724fc87f49"))
